OL,3,GNEWSAWe're just tax-collectors, say pub
OL,4,Alandlords asking for help
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign to save local independent
OL,7,Fpubs that started after the last budget
OL,8,Fis urging the government to help them
OL,9,Fin this one.
OL,11,FIn his first week as Prime Minister,
OL,12,FAndy Burnham pledged to cut business
OL,13,Frates for pubs by 20%. Details are
OL,14,Fexpected from his Chancellor, John
OL,15,FHealey, in the Budget on Wednesday.
OL,17,FBut as Hannah Winman, a pub campaigner
OL,18,Ffrom Lydney, Gloucestershire, put it:
OL,19,F"Most pubs saw their business rates go
OL,20,Fup 100% last year, so a 20% discount
OL,21,Fdoesn't cut it."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
