OL,3,GNEWSAWe're just tax-collectors, say pub
OL,4,Alandlords asking for help
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother landlord, Rob Moore, who runs a
OL,7,Fpub in Keynsham, between Bristol and
OL,8,FBath, said he had not made any profit
OL,9,Ffor three years. "There's so many
OL,10,Ftaxes, you just struggle to keep up,"
OL,11,Fhe said.
